                <pb facs="0499" n="399" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg399"/>

                <head>No. 272.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Benjamin to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 15, 1884</date>.
                        (Received March 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 57.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that my
                    attention was called officially to a repetition of the outrages at Hamadan in
                    November. * * * Anxious to obtain official evidence as to the cases, and also to
                    satisfy myself that our citizens at Hamadan had conducted themselves with
                    discretion, I felt it my duty to dispatch our dragoman, Mr. Keün, to Hamadan. He
                    went on the 18th January, and returned on the 12th instant. * * * His conduct at
                    Hamadan was vigorous and effective, and <pb facs="0500" n="400" xml:id="pg400"/>
                    merits the commendation of the Department. But the story of what occurred there,
                    together with all the evidence he obtained, forms along narrative, which is not
                    yet complete. As soon as matters are brought to a successful termination I shall
                    report these transactions in full. In the mean time I beg to submit to the
                    Department the accompanying letter and petition, forwarded to me by our citizens
                    at Hamadan.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>S. G. W. BENJAMIN.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d272-a1.xml" xpointer="d272-a1"/>
            </div>
